WEBVTT

00:11:59.356 --> 00:12:00.756
of resolving it a little bit.

00:12:00.756 --> 00:12:01.916
L: Absolutely.

00:12:01.956 --> 00:12:05.756
But I think that, you know,
even just, you know, prepping for this,

00:12:05.796 --> 00:12:08.396
I start to think about like, you know,

00:12:08.436 --> 00:12:11.116
there could have been more things
that I could have done

00:12:11.156 --> 00:12:13.556
if I had just put myself
a little bit out there,

00:12:13.596 --> 00:12:16.436
if I didn't, just try to hide so much.

00:12:16.436 --> 00:12:17.996
DHP: OK, alright.

00:12:17.996 --> 00:12:19.356
This is fascinating, Lily,

00:12:19.396 --> 00:12:22.396
and I have to say,
I have this database of regrets.

00:12:22.436 --> 00:12:26.116
And you can search the database.

00:12:26.156 --> 00:12:28.836
And if I were to search the database

00:12:28.836 --> 00:12:33.196
for the phrase "speak up,"
"spoke up," "spoken up,"